705","id":3629084908,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7YT3Ds","user":{"login":"deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas","html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-08T21:30:37Z","updated_at":"2025-12-08T21:30:37Z","body":"Hi, I've experimented a bit, and now I understand what you mean by \"not being able to properly handle the retraction of popup windows\".\r\n\r\nI'm afraid that this might be more complicated than expected as, outside of all the code changes I requested in my review, we need other changes (that I haven't fully identified yet) to make it work properly in all cases, such as focus management logic, and the game embedder.\r\n\r\nUnfortunately the Wayland backend has some really weird input handling as we need to fit into the already existing input API, which wasn't built with it in mind.\r\n\r\nBecause of all the above, I'm looking into making a PR from scratch in a way that fits all the requirements, so that the experience is as smooth as possible.\r\n\r\nThank you for your contribution nonetheless!","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3629